<section class="policy-section">
    <div class="auto-container">
        <div class="sec-title centered">
            <div class="sec-title_title">Legal</div>
            <h2 class="sec-title_heading">How We Handle Your <span>Data</span></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p>We collect information you submit through registration, contact, checkout, and newsletter forms. This
                may include parent/guardian details, participant information, and booking-related data.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>2. Why We Use Information</h4>
            <p>Data is used to manage inquiries, process bookings/payments, coordinate program logistics, and deliver
                important updates before, during, and after program operations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>3. Payment Data</h4>
            <p>Payments are processed through secure third-party providers. We do not store full card details on our
                servers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>4. Data Sharing</h4>
            <p>We share data only with trusted service providers required for operations (e.g., payment processing,
                communication, hosting) and only to the extent needed to deliver our services.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>5. Data Protection</h4>
            <p>We apply appropriate technical and operational measures to protect personal information from unauthorized
                access, misuse, or disclosure.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-card">
            <h4>6. Your Rights</h4>
            <p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of your personal information by contacting our team
                through the Contact page.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
